  {
   "id": "scen266.0001",
   "jp": "{v:0030}さ、ここからがアンタの作戦能力の見せ所よ！{p}{v:0031}市民に被害も出さずに済ませれば、{n}きっとアンタのこと見直してくれるって！",
   "en": "{v:0030}Okay, here's your chance to show what a great{n}strategist you are!{p}{v:0031}Get through this without any civilians getting hurt, and{n}they're sure to think better of you!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0002",
   "jp": "{v:0032}私と孫はどうすればいいんだ？",
   "en": "{v:0032}What should my grandchild and I do?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0003",
   "jp": "・その場で防御",
   "en": "・Defend in place",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0004",
   "jp": "・闘技場の入り口へ",
   "en": "・Head to the arena entrance",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0005",
   "jp": "{v:0033}わかった。",
   "en": "{v:0033}Understood.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0006",
   "jp": "{v:0033}わかった。{p}{v:0034}さあ、行くぞ。",
   "en": "{v:0033}Understood.{p}{v:0034}Come on, let's go.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0007",
   "jp": "{v:0035}うん。",
   "en": "{v:0035}Okay.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0008",
   "jp": "{v:0036}俺たちはどうするんだ？",
   "en": "{v:0036}What should we do?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0009",
   "jp": "・その場で待機",
   "en": "・Wait where you are",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0010",
   "jp": "・闘技場の入り口へ",
   "en": "・Head to the arena entrance",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true,
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0011",
   "jp": "{v:0037}わ、わかった。",
   "en": "{v:0037}G-got it.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0012",
   "jp": "{v:0038}絶対守って下さいね。",
   "en": "{v:0038}Please make sure you protect us.",
   "term": "end",
