   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0026",
   "jp": "{FFEE}市民に犠牲を出さずに敵を倒せ！{FFF1}",
   "en": "{FFEE}Defeat the enemies without losing any civilians!{FFF1}",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0027",
   "jp": "{v:0040}畜生！{n}これでも食らえ！",
   "en": "{v:0040}Damn it! Take this!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0028",
   "jp": "{v:0041}やってやる！{n}やってやるぞ！",
   "en": "{v:0041}I'll do it! I'll show you!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0029",
   "jp": "{v:0042}もう破れかぶれだ！",
   "en": "{v:0042}I've got nothing left to lose!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0030",
   "jp": "{v:0043}う‥ぐわあ‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0043}Ugh... Gwaaah...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0031",
   "jp": "{v:0044}うわぁーー！",
   "en": "{v:0044}Aaaah!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0032",
   "jp": "{v:0045}そ、そんな‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0045}N-no...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0033",
   "jp": "{v:0046}あ、ああ‥死にたく‥ない‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0046}A-ah... I don't... want to die...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0034",
   "jp": "もうダメだ‥‥。",
   "en": "I'm done for...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0035",
   "jp": "まだ死にたくねぇよ‥‥。",
   "en": "I don't wanna die yet...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0036",
   "jp": "なんで俺が殺されなきゃ‥‥。",
   "en": "Why the hell do I have to die...?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0037",
   "jp": "{v:004C}もういないようだな。",
   "en": "{v:004C}Looks like that's all of them.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0038",
   "jp": "{v:004D}まったく、油断も隙もあったもんじゃないわね？",
   "en": "{v:004D}Honestly! We can't let our guard down for a second,{n}can we?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0039",
   "jp": "{v:0047}こっちの方で騒ぎがあったみたいだけど‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0047}It sounded like there was some sort of commotion{n}over here...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0040",
   "jp": "{v:0048}ルイセちゃん！",
   "en": "{v:0048}Luise-chan!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0041",
   "jp": "{v:0049}ん？{n}どうしたんだ！？",
   "en": "{v:0049}Huh? What happened?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen266.0042",
   "jp": "{v:004A}敵よ！{n}敵が襲ってきたの！",
